# ★ 例外：带日期的取证副本必须入库（验收纪律第 21 条：可达性证据会被下一次构建覆盖）
!firmware/Output/bms_20*.hex
!firmware/Output/map_20*.map
firmware/Projects/MDK-ARM/b.log
firmware/Projects/MDK-ARM/Events/
firmware/Projects/MDK-ARM/Listings/
firmware/Projects/MDK-ARM/Objects/
